  "historyNote": "#9580, eff 10-24-09; amd by #9851, eff 1-14-11; amd by #10079, eff 1-26-12; ss by #12407, INTERIM, eff 10-24-17, EXPIRED: 4-22-18 New. #13166, eff 1-28-21; ss by #14081, eff 9-25-24, EXPIRES: 9-25-34 (formerly He-P 802.21)",
